External tools that are NOT bundled or redistributed
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

FEMM (Finite Element Method Magnetics)
  https://www.femm.info/

  MotorCalculator's finite-element validation features detect and drive an
  existing FEMM installation on the user's machine through generated Lua
  scripts. No FEMM source, binary, library or data file is included in this
  repository or in any MotorCalculator distribution, and no right to
  redistribute FEMM is claimed or granted. FEMM is subject to its own license
  terms. The application runs normally without FEMM installed; only the
  validation features become unavailable.

